  "prompt": "For every non-NULL category, return product_id, category, price for all products in its two highest DISTINCT non-NULL price levels. Include every tie. Categories with only one known price level return that level. Product IDs are unique; zero and negative prices are valid. Output order does not matter.",
  "context": "Merchandising wants complete price tiers, so an arbitrary two products per category would produce an unstable campaign.",
